# Architecture & TypeScript Core

## Folder organization (React)

Follow React’s guidance: group by **business domain**, colocate files that change together, avoid deep nesting. Do **not** use Clean Architecture layer folder names (`domain` / `application` / `infrastructure` / `presentation`).

```
src/
├── app/                 # Next.js App Router shell
├── components/          # Shared reusable UI (shadcn under components/ui)
├── hooks/               # Shared hooks
├── lib/                 # Shared non-UI helpers (utils, persistence, history, store facade)
├── canvas/              # Business domain: UI + store + hooks + types together
├── component/
├── template/
├── theme/
├── data/
├── chart/
├── form/
├── export/
└── collaboration/
```

References: [React File Structure FAQ](https://legacy.reactjs.org/docs/faq-structure.html), [Next.js App Router](https://nextjs.org/docs/app)

## Soft dependency habits

```
business-domain UI → domain helpers/stores → shared lib/components/hooks
```

- Prefer direct imports over fat barrels for app entry points
- `components/ui/index.ts` exports **primitives only** (never business-domain shells) — re-exporting shells caused Turbopack hangs
- Pure type/helper modules should not import React when avoidable

## Forbidden in New Code

- Clean Architecture layer directories: `domain/`, `application/`, `infrastructure/`, `presentation/`
- Global layer roots: `src/domain/`, `src/application/`, `src/presentation/`, `src/shared/`, `src/common/{layer}/`
- `domain/port/`, `*Port` suffix, `adapter/in|out` packages

## Business domains

| Folder | Owns |
|--------|------|
| `canvas` | Canvas UI, properties panel, canvas store / hooks |
| `component` | Types, factory, management, panel / renderer, component stores |
| `template` | Gallery, template command, template data |
| `theme` | Theme store / editor, animation editor |
| `data` | Data source / binding, data store, data panel |
| `chart` | Chart components + chart renderer |
| `form` | Form builder + form renderer |
| `export` | Code export UI |
| `collaboration` | Collaboration UI |
| `components` | Shared UI kit + shell chrome |
| `hooks` | Cross-domain hooks |
| `lib` | `cn`/utils, persistence, history, store composition |

## TypeScript Naming

| Type | Rule | Example |
|------|------|---------|
| Component | PascalCase | `ComponentPanel` |
| Store | camelCase + Store | `useComponentStore` |
| Service / helper | PascalCase or descriptive file | `ComponentManagementService` |
| Types / interfaces | PascalCase | `ThemeConfig` |
| Methods / vars | camelCase | `findById` |
| Constants | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | `MAX_HISTORY` |
| Files | kebab-case | `component-panel.tsx` |

## Test Naming

`should_expected_when_condition` (or Vitest `it("should ...")` matching the same intent).

